  ✓ Stages 4–5: audit claim adequacy, real-program pinning, and every local rule/declaration
  ✓ Stage 6: create and run a fresh meaningful false mutation
  ✓ Stage 7: account for proved versus assumed facts and write REVIEW.md with the final verdict
